5,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf together.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A pleasure to meet you all. I believe a rational approach, focusing on logical inconsistencies, will be our best tool here.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,Greetings. Let us maintain a spirit of harmony. Wisdom often reveals itself in the quietest moments of observation.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,Hi everyone! I'm sure this will be fun. I'll be watching all of you very closely to see who's acting a bit too perfect.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready. Let's just be honest. If you're a villager, say it. If you're lying, I'll figure it out.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you're very brave. Do you think we should tell everyone our roles right away, or is that too dangerous?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Transparency is a double-edged sword, Minato. A werewolf can easily mimic a villager, but they cannot mimic the truth of a Seer.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed. Patience is a virtue. If we rush to judge, we may accidentally cast out one of our own.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, Servas is already playing the ""wise elder"" card. How charming. I think we should provoke people a bit to see them crack.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I don't like games. I think we should trust the people who aren't acting weird or trying to manipulate us.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I agree with Servas. Being peaceful is better. I don't want anyone to feel attacked unless we are sure.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"While peace is pleasant, we must remember the objective. We need a system to track contradictions in statements.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,A balanced approach is best. We listen to the heart as much as the head.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, you're so clinical. Tell me, do you always treat social interactions like a math problem?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Leave him alone, May. If his logic helps us win, then that's what we need.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,I'll try my best to help. I'm just curious to see how everyone thinks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the support, Takumi. Let us observe the first night's results and proceed with caution.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,Let us enter the night with a clear mind and a hopeful heart.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,"I'm still keeping my eye on you, Minato. You're almost too sweet.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
