31,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning. I'm glad we're all still here. Does anyone have any thoughts on who might be suspicious?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I have some information. Based on my initial investigation, I have a very strong suspicion regarding Minato.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,"That is a bold claim so early, Benjamin. Are you certain your intuition is not leading you astray?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"Oh! The plot thickens! @Benjamin, are you claiming to be the Seer? That's a very risky move.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"If Benjamin says it's Minato, I'm listening. He's been the most logical one so far.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,@Benjamin? Why me? I've only been trying to be nice. I'm just a villager! I promise!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Your gentleness is a wonderful facade, Minato, but the evidence of my divination does not lie.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,We must be careful. A werewolf could easily claim to be the Seer to frame an innocent villager.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"Exactly. @Minato, you look terrified. Is it because you're guilty, or because you're being bullied?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Minato, if you're innocent, tell us why Benjamin would lie.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I don't know why! I haven't done anything! Please, I'm just a normal person. I'm scared.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Emotional appeals are the primary weapon of the deceptive. Logic dictates that the Seer's result is the only hard fact.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,"While logic is strong, the risk of executing a villager on day one is a heavy burden for the village.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,I don't know... Minato is acting the part of the victim perfectly. It's almost too convincing. I'm leaning toward Benjamin.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I don't buy it. Servas is being too protective of Minato. That's a red flag for me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Servas, thank you for doubting. Please, everyone, don't believe him!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The more the Possessed tries to shield the Werewolf, the more obvious the alliance becomes.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I only seek to prevent a mistake, Takumi. Let us not let suspicion cloud our judgment.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,This is getting interesting. I'll vote based on who seems the most desperate.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting for Minato. Benjamin's confidence is real.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
